  "abstract": "RFFT-based Fourier forecaster with LayerNorm on real/imag, residual copy head, and a fixed scalar ramp \u03b3 over horizon (0.25\u21920.99). Small head H=128. Tests if ramp baseline can match LN-RFFT results at lr=1e-3.",
